[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3844.47, "timestamp": "01:04:04", "text": "はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3847.91, "timestamp": "01:04:07", "text": "その鎧は何だ、兄弟？ うん。 ああ、アストラがくれたんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3850.069, "timestamp": "01:04:10", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3852.47, "timestamp": "01:04:12", "text": "超殺傷アーマー。 ねえ、どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3860.309, "timestamp": "01:04:20", "text": "ウルトラキルアーマーはどうやって入手するのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3863.43, "timestamp": "01:04:23", "text": "ウルトラキルアーマーの入手方法は？   あれは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3865.75, "timestamp": "01:04:25", "text": "何でしょう？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3868.95, "timestamp": "01:04:28", "text": "あなたがくれたロボットの装甲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3871.349, "timestamp": "01:04:31", "text": "ああ、テクノロジーが必要だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3871.99, "timestamp": "01:04:31", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3874.069, "timestamp": "01:04:34", "text": "ああ、そうだね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3875.91, "timestamp": "01:04:35", "text": "。 つまり、基本的にはそのレシピを入手する必要があります。そうすれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3884.069, "timestamp": "01:04:44", "text": "レシピは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3890.309, "timestamp": "01:04:50", "text": "古代のセグメント"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3899.19, "timestamp": "01:04:59", "text": "。"}]